        "key": "FEV_Town_10Cry_41_002",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_10Cry_41:FEV_Town_10Cry_41_002:e0cb5616",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_10Cry_41:FEV_Town_10Cry_41_002:e0cb5616",
        "jp_sha256": "9611ec1bdd3e90f98a070ba969b20cdbfc0e7be7c1ef2cb2f60673f9c5969721",
        "official_en_sha256": "5e5494c1d31b2c168e547004600bbfe80e4572c9cb9cfd3f577ff08a87d18aa9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あの頂上にいる魔物……\r\nあんなに禍々しいものにも\r\nあんたは果敢に挑んでいくんだね。",
        "official_en": "That nasty thing up there... You’re going to walk right up to it and fight it, huh?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
