      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いてもたってもいられず\r\n３人で飛空艇から応援に来たラリ！",
        "official_en": "We just had to hop out of the airship to help, lali!",
        "real_en": "The three of us couldn't just sit still, so we came down from the airship to help, lali!"
      },
