      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "リドたち、こんなとこまで来て\r\nすごいラリ！\r\n外はズイブンいい景色ラリな～！",
        "official_en": "Killer view, eh, Lid? Can’t believe you climbed all the way up here!",
        "real_en": "Lid, you and the others made it all the way here! That's amazing, lali! And what a view outside, lali!"
      },
